        <p class="mb-4">We do not store plain-text database secrets. All API keys, Twilio authorization hashes, and ElevenLabs voice vectors are compiled, isolated in environmental modules, and locked utilizing industry-grade RLS (Row-Level Security) algorithms.</p>
