        <p class="mb-4">Our application utilizes LocalStorage (under keys such as "theme" and "naxton_consultations") to preserve system aesthetic states and mock consultation ticket submissions locally on your machine. This information is never transmitted to unverified external trackers.</p>
        <h4 class="font-orbitron font-bold text-white text-[11px] mb-2 uppercase">4. CONTACT</h4>
        <p>For regulatory enquiries, contact legal@naxtontechnologies.com.</p>
      `,
      terms: `
        <h4 class="font-orbitron font-bold text-white text-[11px] mb-2 uppercase">1. SERVICE ENGAGEMENT</h4>
        <p class="mb-4">By accessing the Naxton web platform, you agree to comply with our environmental sandbox regulations. Our simulated voice components and database rotation routines are provided strictly for demonstration and testing purposes.</p>
